 148:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       it allows to register following callbacks:
 149:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) ErrorCallback : callback when error occurs.
 150:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) AbortCpltCallback : callback when abort is completed.
 151:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) FifoThresholdCallback : callback when the fifo threshold is reached.
 152:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) CmdCpltCallback : callback when a command without data is completed.
 153:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) RxCpltCallback : callback when a reception transfer is completed.
 154:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) TxCpltCallback : callback when a transmission transfer is completed.
 155:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) RxHalfCpltCallback : callback when half of the reception transfer is completed.
 156:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) TxHalfCpltCallback : callback when half of the transmission transfer is completed.
 157:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) StatusMatchCallback : callback when a status match occurs.
 158:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****         (+) TimeOutCallback : callback when the timeout perioed expires.
