 181:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       all callbacks are reset to the corresponding legacy weak (overridden) functions.
 182:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit callbacks that are respectively
 183:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       reset to the legacy weak (overridden) functions in the HAL_QSPI_Init
 184:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       and  HAL_QSPI_DeInit only when these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 185:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_QSPI_Init and HAL_QSPI_DeInit
 186:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_qspi.c ****       keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand)
